    {
      "kind": "synopsis",
      "source_text": "もうすぐ直央の誕生日。\nかのんと志狼はプロデューサーを巻き込み\n『お誕生日大作戦』を開始する。\n誕生日当日、何も知らない直央が事務所で\n発見したものとは……？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 1
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:step-1:text",
        "step_id": 1,
        "step_index": 0,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "えへへっ。まだなおくんに\nお誕生日会、気づかれてないね。\n作戦その1、いい感じ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "姫野 かのん"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "034kan"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "034kan",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 4
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "おう！　プレゼントもバッチリ\n用意できたしな。作戦その2も\n超ジュンチョーだぜ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "橘 志狼"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "033shr"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "033shr",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 5
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "プロデューサーさんに、\nみんなのケーキや飲み物も\n準備してもらったし……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "姫野 かのん"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "034kan"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "034kan",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 6
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あとはなおが手紙を見つけて、\nラウンジに来るのを待つだけ！\nへへ、いつ来るかな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "橘 志狼"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "033shr"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "033shr",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 7
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "かわいいうさぎさんの封筒にした\nから、きっとすぐに見つけて\nくれるはず♪",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "姫野 かのん"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "034kan"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "034kan",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 8
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "へへ。なおが来たら思いっきり\nクラッカー鳴らしてやるの、\nすっげー楽しみだぜ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "橘 志狼"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "033shr"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "033shr",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 9
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "しろうくん、今日のために\n将棋倶楽部まで、\n行ってくれてたんだね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "岡村 直央"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "032nao"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "032nao",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 11
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ああ。なおが今まで知らなかった\nってことは、ヒミツにしてくれ\nって、約束守ってくれたんだな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "橘 志狼"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "033shr"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "033shr",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 12
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "みんな、いい人たちだから……。\nボクも長い間お世話になってて、\n楽しく将棋ができる場所なんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "岡村 直央"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "032nao"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "032nao",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 13
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "おー、みんなたくさんお菓子を\nくれるし、また遊びに\n行ってやってもいいぜ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "橘 志狼"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "033shr"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "033shr",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 14
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "本当？　じゃあ、今度はボクと\nしろうくん、かのんくんの3人で\n行こうよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "岡村 直央"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "032nao"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "032nao",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 15
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "将棋って、いろんな遊び方が\nあるんだね。かのんでもすぐに\nできちゃうのもあったし♪",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "姫野 かのん"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "034kan"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "034kan",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 17
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうだよ、将棋は指す以外にも\n遊べるんだよ。それを\n知ってもらえて嬉しいな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "岡村 直央"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "032nao"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "032nao",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 18
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:step-18:text",
        "step_id": 18,
        "step_index": 17,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "回り将棋よりも簡単なものも\nあるんだよ。例えば山崩しとか、\n重ね将棋とか……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "岡村 直央"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "032nao"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "032nao",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 19
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "へ～！　そういえば、他にも\nリバーシとかドミノみたいな\n遊び方もあるって聞いたなぁ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "姫野 かのん"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "034kan"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "034kan",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 20
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
